шифр 419999 зс5^
лен 41(2048)^
eeв1а3
*name pz basic
*no list
*assembler
C No task registry is enabled for this test.  Calls that require an
C existing ПЗ must report "no such subordinate"; self-local event calls
C and the "my master channel" query must still succeed with zero.
 program: ,name,
C E53 25 declares a master by шифр; a bogus шифр is not found.
	  ,xta , badc
	  ,*53 , 25b
	  ,atx , res
	  ,*64 , inf64
C E53 27 appeals to the master; without one, the task is not subordinate.
	  ,xta ,
	  ,*53 , 27b
	  ,atx , res
	  ,*64 , inf64
C E53 30 stop ПЗ; there is no subordinate selected on the accumulator.
	  ,xta ,
	  ,*53 , 30b
	  ,atx , res
	  ,*64 , inf64
C E53 36 get/clear ПЗ event scale; again there is no selected ПЗ.
	  ,xta ,
	  ,*53 , 36b
	  ,atx , res
	  ,*64 , inf64
C E53 16 and E53 20 are own-task event-mask queries and work without ПЗ.
	  ,xta ,
	  ,*53 , 16b
	  ,atx , res
	  ,*64 , inf64
	  ,xta ,
	  ,*53 , 20b
	  ,atx , res
	  ,*64 , inf64
C E50 207 returns this task's master program channel; top-level task has 0.
	  ,xta ,
	  ,*50 , 207b
	  ,atx , res
	  ,*64 , inf64
	  ,call, stop*
 badc:	  ,oct , 7777 7777
 res:	  ,log , 0
 inf64:	  ,    , res
	  ,    , res
	 2,    , 20b
	 8,    ,
	  ,end ,
*execute
*end file
``````
